      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen, isn't your private \r\nquarters getting a bit cramped?\r\nActually, to make your stay more comfortable,\r\nI was thinking of proposing a renovation--",
        "Jp" : "覚者さま、自室もそろそろ手狭ではありませんか？\r\n実は、より快適に過ごしていただくため\r\n改築をご提案しようかと――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 593592,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
